Rejected records were written into a Silver quarantine Delta table with the original values, validation flags, rejection reasons, Batch ID, and rejection timestamp.

I also handled duplicate Product IDs by partitioning records by product_id, ordering them by the latest Modified Timestamp, and retaining only the latest record. Older records from the same batch were classified as duplicates and sent to quarantine.

